# Protocol — Periodic checkpoint ({{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}})

Fires every {{CHECKPOINT_EVERY}} experiments (`exp_id % {{CHECKPOINT_EVERY}} == 0`). Stop
feature-chasing and reorient: confirm the campaign is still healthy and still pointed at the goal.

## 1. Re-anchor
Re-read {{REANCHOR_DOCS}} and `results/DISCOVERIES.md`. Is the current line of work still the best use
of effort, or has a discovery changed what's possible?

## 2. Review the scoreboard
Sort `results/scoreboard.tsv` by {{SCOREBOARD_REVIEW_SORTS}}. Where is the real progress? Which levers
are exhausted? Is the current-best genuinely ahead of the floor by more than the spread?

## 3. Hygiene checks
{{HYGIENE_CHECKS}}
<!-- e.g. every row has a result_<NN>.json; the current-best config is reproducible; no orphaned
     PROVISIONAL findings; the guardrail still behaves on known-good/known-bad inputs; diagnostics
     logs are persisted, not console-only. -->

## 4. Re-plan
Pick the {{REPLAN_HORIZON}} most promising orthogonal directions for the next block of experiments and
write them as the JOURNAL **NEXT** pointer. If progress has plateaued, trigger a literature search.
